WEBVTT

00:00:09.749 --> 00:00:13.285
We will build a graphical user interface: a visible

00:00:13.285 --> 00:00:14.672
window with content.

00:00:14.672 --> 00:00:18.000
Our goal is to connect its parts, then close and

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.149
reopen it in Workspace Desktop.

00:00:41.740 --> 00:00:43.739
A Stage is the native window.

00:00:43.739 --> 00:00:46.151
A Scene connects it to its content.

00:00:46.151 --> 00:00:49.734
The Label displays text, and StackPane is the layout

00:00:49.734 --> 00:00:52.008
container that places that label.

00:00:52.008 --> 00:00:55.592
Together, the parent and child form a scene graph, a

00:00:55.592 --> 00:00:57.315
tree of visible elements.

00:00:57.442 --> 00:01:00.775
Predict which text appears in the title bar and which

00:01:00.775 --> 00:01:02.410
appears inside the window.

00:01:02.410 --> 00:01:04.171
Where will the label appear?

00:01:04.171 --> 00:01:05.492
Pause before running.

00:01:18.200 --> 00:01:20.627
Course Welcome is the window title.

00:01:20.627 --> 00:01:23.817
Welcome to C S C two thirty-nine is the label.

00:01:23.817 --> 00:01:26.730
StackPane centers that child in the scene.

00:01:26.730 --> 00:01:29.434
The console reports this initial state.

00:01:29.434 --> 00:01:32.000
The visible window is on the Desktop.

00:01:32.035 --> 00:01:33.731
Close the native window.

00:01:33.731 --> 00:01:37.335
This standalone application's process finishes when

00:01:37.335 --> 00:01:38.960
its last window closes.

00:01:48.979 --> 00:01:52.321
Running the command again starts a new process and

00:01:52.321 --> 00:01:53.725
creates a new window.

00:01:53.725 --> 00:01:57.335
Application supplies the runner: launch begins it, and

00:01:57.335 --> 00:02:00.811
start builds the interface on the JavaFX Application

00:02:00.811 --> 00:02:03.485
Thread, its sequence for interface work.

00:02:03.485 --> 00:02:07.095
Notebook examples instead use the supplied Fx support,

00:02:07.095 --> 00:02:10.504
which keeps JavaFX available after a window closes.

00:02:13.479 --> 00:02:16.604
Which object would you change to replace the welcome

00:02:16.604 --> 00:02:19.729
message, and which object would you change to rename

00:02:19.729 --> 00:02:20.390
the window?

00:02:20.390 --> 00:02:22.554
Explain your choices before editing.
